  "title": "SOPHiA GENETICS Enters Collaboration to Develop Companion Diagnostics for Precision Oncology Therapies",
  "summary": "BOSTON and ROLLE – August 4, 2026 – SOPHiA GENETICS (NASDAQ: SOPH) today announced a new global collaboration to develop, validate, and deploy two companion diagnostics (CDx) supporting precision oncology therapies with AstraZeneca (LSE/STO/NYSE: AZN). This multi-year collaboration agreement will advance the development and commercialization of two companion diagnostic programs, bringing SOPHiA GENETICS’s decentralized clinical trial assays and companion diagnostic […]",
